  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe setup's Machine page (properties pane, tree row \"Machine\") follows the WCS page's layout, slice 4 of #1440 (after Stock #1460, Tool list #1465, Fixtures #1471):\n\n- Three titled `layout::group` sections: **Which machine** (own / document choice and its hint), **Machine file** (one quiet helper line, the Library combo as a label | control row, then the overview grid with Source, or the unchanged no-machine message) and **Change machine** (Load other / Edit / Clear as equal-width buttons; the single \"Load machine (.mch)\" button with none).\n- The page body moved to `machine_page.rs`; `machine_section` left `pages.rs` (far past the 400-line law). `ownership`/`Mount` became `pub(super)`; its trailing separator moved to the Post page, its other caller.\n- Layout only: no command, parameter or project-file change. Every edit is the same undoable command as before (`LoadBuiltinMachine`, `LoadMachineDialog`, `EditMachineDialog`, `ClearMachine`, `SetupOwnMachine`). The inactive-setup \"Activate\" prompt and the raised-rotary rows are untouched.\n- **Scope:** the properties-pane page only. The Machine editor window (`machine_editor.rs`, `machine_edm_editor.rs`) is a separate floating window with its own layout and would need its own slice; open PR #1218 edits `machine_editor.rs`.\n\n## Pinned by (crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/machine_page.rs)\n\n- `the_machine_page_is_laid_out_in_groups_like_the_wcs_page` - mill (Tormach 770MX): group titles stack in order, ownership under \"Which machine\", helper then Library then the seven overview rows plus Source each on its value's row, label left of value, three equal buttons on one row under \"Change machine\", no empty message / no-machine button.\n- `the_machine_page_lays_out_a_lathe_in_the_same_rows` - Lathe: same seven rows plus Source, Kind \"Turning\".\n- `the_machine_page_keeps_its_message_and_load_button_with_no_machine` - empty state: every previous string in place and order, mill-only rows and buttons absent.\n- `the_machine_page_buttons_still_queue_their_commands` - Clear drops the machine, the page follows, Undo restores it.\n- `the_machine_page_keeps_the_rotary_rows_last` - rotary heading below the actions.\n- `the_machine_page_of_an_inactive_setup_offers_only_activation` - degenerate: no group is drawn.\n\nExisting `the_machine_page_shows_a_property_grid`, `the_setup_machine_page_*` and `the_machine_page_shows_the_rotary_rows_*` still pass.\n\n## Mutation checks (each applied alone to `machine_page.rs`, machine_page tests re-run; all red, file restored)\n\n| Mutation | Red tests |\n|---|---|\n| delete the helper line | groups, no-machine |\n| delete the \"Library\" label | groups, no-machine, lathe |\n| drop the Source row | groups, lathe, `setup_tree::the_machine_page_shows_a_property_grid` |\n| drop the no-machine message | no-machine, buttons |\n| drop the Edit button | groups, buttons |\n| Clear button no longer queues ClearMachine | buttons |\n| drop the ownership group | groups, no-machine, two `setup_mount_pages` tests |\n| rename \"Machine file\" title | 2 tests |\n| action group before the file group | groups, no-machine, lathe |\n| buttons at half width (not equal-fill) | groups |\n| rename the no-machine button | no-machine |\n\nMutations that stay green: none of those tried. Not exercised: clicking \"Load other\" and \"Edit\" (they open file / editor dialogs; only the Clear command path is click-tested), and the library combo pick (covered by the existing `the_setup_machine_page_picks_its_own_machine_from_the_library`). Snapshot PNGs are untouched.\n\n## Gates\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` green; `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- --test-threads=1` and `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` green (680 passed, 5 ignored; clippy clean on ui and app, all targets).\n\n## Screenshots: before/after attached below\n\n(Local files: `~/Desktop/camcraft/builds/pr-1440-machine/` before.png, after.png, before-empty.png, after-empty.png - Tormach 770MX loaded, and no machine.)\n\n## Overlap\n\nOpen PRs touching these files: #1460/#1465/#1471 touch `pages.rs` / `setup_pages.rs` / `mod.rs` / `tests.rs` in other places (textual merge conflicts on `mod.rs`/`tests.rs` module lists and `pages.rs`/`setup_pages.rs` hunks are likely; resolved by keeping both sides). #1218 edits `machine_editor.rs` (not touched here). #1124, #1209, #773 edit `pages.rs`/`setup_pages.rs` elsewhere.\n\nFork synced at v0.19.0 process files; branch off upstream/main 7c21c9c.\n\nChangelog: The Machine page is laid out in titled groups (Which machine, Machine file, Change machine) with equal-width buttons, like the WCS page (#1440)\n\nRefs #1440\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX\n",
